**Plan Plasm** (dry-run): **`logical_session_ref`** + **`program`**. Returns reviewable plan topology. When **`dry_verdict`** is `review`, the response includes **`plan_commit_ref`** (`pcN`) in the Markdown body (and `_meta.plasm`) — pass that token to **`plasm_run`**; do not use **`force: true`** unless you intentionally skip review. Grammar is in MCP initialize; symbols come from **`plasm_context`** TSV.
